  m_Name: 7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  fullText: 'Entry 3                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \n\nThe Visitor is made out of a metal composed of several known\nminerals. However,
    there are some unidentifiable components that\ngive further evidence to my theory.                                                                                                                                                                                 
    \nWhile we continue analyzing its structure, I have begun researching\nhow it
    interacts when in contact with water, as the soldiers think that is\nwhat caused
    it to "open".                                                                                                                                                                                  '
